                                        "entry_id": "c1e2fc3f-0179-3f2a-9abd-da08d8c16f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something used to carry a thing, especially a frame for wicks in candle-making."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8964f55b-1924-3a6e-ada8-e66a63abd708",
                                        "entry_id": "c1e2fc3f-0179-3f2a-9abd-da08d8c16f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The manner in which a person carries himself; bearing; deportment; carriage. See also portance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f202708-ec09-44dd-8395-59c42a41b056",
                                                "sense_id": "8964f55b-1924-3a6e-ada8-e66a63abd708",
                                                "text": "Those same with stately grace, and princely port / She taught to tread, when she her selfe would grace […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c9298a-85f7-4f8c-a638-cfaad0d799e1",
                                                "sense_id": "8964f55b-1924-3a6e-ada8-e66a63abd708",
                                                "text": "the necessities of pomp, grandeur, and a suitable port in the world"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52085b43-313a-47a2-a608-dbe9a6321c9f",
                                                "sense_id": "8964f55b-1924-3a6e-ada8-e66a63abd708",
                                                "text": "For the port, the voice, the smell, the hairdress, were seldom the same, from one day to the next, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18702452-1a62-38cb-b958-e8376f964824",
                                        "entry_id": "c1e2fc3f-0179-3f2a-9abd-da08d8c16f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The position of a weapon when ported; a rifle position executed by throwing the weapon diagonally across the front of the body, with the right hand grasping the small of the stock and the barrel sloping upward and crossing the point of the left shoulder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34d91525-cc05-3b43-90cd-2289e6bcf3ad",
                                        "entry_id": "c1e2fc3f-0179-3f2a-9abd-da08d8c16f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A program that has been adapted, modified, or recoded so that it works on a different platform; the act of this adapting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03b911dd-05a2-4f98-8024-1ecc9ff8804b",
                                                "sense_id": "34d91525-cc05-3b43-90cd-2289e6bcf3ad",
                                                "text": "Gamers can't wait until a port of the title is released on the new system."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d7f459e-bb15-4cf6-93dc-c748135d3d20",
                                                "sense_id": "34d91525-cc05-3b43-90cd-2289e6bcf3ad",
                                                "text": "The latest port of the database software is the worst since we made the changeover."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61cb50af-500d-3cbf-ac28-703af127170d",
                                        "entry_id": "c1e2fc3f-0179-3f2a-9abd-da08d8c16f77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of files used to build and install a binary executable file from the source code of an application."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
